# Mjölnir ignore file — paths excluded from scanning at discovery time.
# Supported syntax (a gitignore subset): **, *, ? wildcards; a pattern
# containing "/" is anchored to the repo root; a bare name (no "/")
# matches at any depth, like gitignore; "!pattern" negates, and the last
# matching pattern wins. (Trailing-"/" directory markers are not supported.)
#
# This repo's fixtures, golden corpus, and demo repo are excluded via
# the "exclude" field in mjolnir.config.json. This file demonstrates
# the .mjolnirignore mechanism for repos that prefer file-based config.

# Machine-local agent tooling (50f847d class — never repo content): the
# walker visits the filesystem, not git, so on machines where the skill
# sync creates these links they must be excluded HERE, not in .gitignore,
# or the symlink skip honestly degrades the self-scan to PARTIAL (exit 2).
# The scanner deliberately never reads .gitignore (hostile-repo boundary).
